IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0007.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FEE0007C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 FW-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 S-CH               PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2000-FEE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "FW-IND=" FW-IND
    DISPLAY "S-CH=" S-CH
    STOP RUN.
2000-FEE-WAIVER.
    IF A-TY = 'G' OR A-TY = 'P' OR WS-AVBL >= 5000.00
        MOVE 'Y' TO FW-IND
        MOVE 0 TO S-CH
    ELSE
        MOVE 10 TO S-CH
    END-IF.
